          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[... fi]ve [d]inars, a wrap [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] dinars, a gown [... dinar(s) and] a half, eight silk pillows\u2014one\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]\u2014one dinar [... These are what she brought from the house of] her [father] and from the Holy One blessed be He\u2014and the upper story of a hou[se ...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] with all [...] that surround i[t] round about. On this understanding]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the two sides [consented.] And [this] gi[rl has reach]ed her maturity and has appointed her uncle Mufarrij the kohen [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... in the pre]sence of two witnesses who were acquainted with] her. Then(?) he wrote for her a ketubba of the Torah and the co[urt] stipulations [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] We performed a [qi]nyan with them with an implement suitable for this for all that is written and specified a[bove. This]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[marriage contract is va]lid and trustworthy in any court where it will be produced and read, whether according to the secular law or according to the statutes [of our lords, the sages.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[In good ord]er. Nathan b. Perahya (whose) s(oul is at) r(est). Caleb b. Joseph (who) r(ests) in E(den) b. C-a-l-e-b, r(emembered) for (a blessing). Judah b. R. Ephraim (who) r(ests in) E(den). Halfon ha Levi b. \u2026</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Mena\u1e25em b. R. Ephraim (who) r(ests in) E(den). Joseph b. [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Shelah b. R. [...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Abraham b. Judah Zur\u02bfa [b. ...]</li></ol>\n",
